#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:2
msgid "1. App, Host, & Scene Lifecycle"
msgstr "1. 应用、宿主与场景生命周期"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:4
msgid ""
"An imperative Fluxent program wires together three objects—``FluxApp`` "
"(window and GPU pipeline), ``XtkHost`` (retained control store and batch "
"validator), and ``XtkScene`` (the ergonomic handle passed to transactions"
" and property setters)."
msgstr ""
"命令式 Fluxent 程序由三个核心对象串联而成—— ``FluxApp`` （原生窗口与 GPU 渲染管线）、 "
"``XtkHost`` （保留式控件仓库与批次校验器）以及 ``XtkScene`` （传给事务与属性设置函数的轻量场景句柄）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:9
msgid "Complete ``fluxent.imp`` Counter Walkthrough"
msgstr "完整 ``fluxent.imp`` 计数器模板解析"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:11
msgid ""
"Running ``xmake create -l c -t fluxent.imp hello`` generates this "
"complete single-file application in ``src/main.c``:"
msgstr "执行 ``xmake create -l c -t fluxent.imp hello`` 会在 ``src/main.c`` 中生成如下完整的单文件应用："

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:148
msgid "Startup & Teardown Order"
msgstr "启动与逆序清理流程"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:150
msgid "Follow this exact five-step lifecycle in every imperative application:"
msgstr "所有命令式应用都遵循以下五步生命周期："

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Register control modules**: Call "
"``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` for each control your "
"transactions instantiate, or ``flux_controls_all()`` to register the "
"entire catalog. Module names in ``<fluxent/flux_controls.h>`` match the "
"lowercase ``XTK_CTRL_<NAME>`` catalog suffix (for example "
"``flux_ctrl_container``, ``flux_ctrl_card``, ``flux_ctrl_scroll``, "
"``flux_ctrl_nav``, ``flux_ctrl_list``, ``flux_ctrl_dialog``)."
msgstr ""
"**注册控件模块** ：对事务中创建的每一种控件调用 ``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` ，"
"或调用 ``flux_controls_all()`` 全量注册。 ``<fluxent/flux_controls.h>`` 中的模块符号名对应小写的 "
"``XTK_CTRL_<NAME>`` 目录后缀（如 ``flux_ctrl_container`` 、 ``flux_ctrl_card`` 、 "
"``flux_ctrl_scroll`` 、 ``flux_ctrl_nav`` 、 ``flux_ctrl_list`` 、 ``flux_ctrl_dialog`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Create** ``FluxApp *``: ``flux_app_create(&cfg)`` creates the native "
"Win32 window, Direct2D/DirectWrite/DirectComposition renderer, theme "
"tracker, IME bridge, and UI Automation provider. Initialize persistent "
"``XtkCtrl`` fields in your state struct to ``XTK_CTRL_INVALID``."
msgstr ""
"**创建** ``FluxApp *`` ： ``flux_app_create(&cfg)`` 创建原生 Win32 窗口、"
"Direct2D/DirectWrite/DirectComposition 渲染引擎、主题监听器、输入法桥接与 UI Automation 无障碍提供程序。"
"状态结构体中的持久 ``XtkCtrl`` 字段初始值设为 ``XTK_CTRL_INVALID`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Attach** ``XtkHost *`` **and wrap** ``XtkScene``: "
"``flux_app_attachhost(app)`` allocates a retained ``XtkHost`` bound to "
"the window's layout root and rendering store. "
"``xtk_scene_fromhost(host)`` returns a copyable ``XtkScene`` value struct"
" whose root control handle is queried via ``xtk_scene_root(&scene)``."
msgstr ""
"**挂载** ``XtkHost *`` **并包装** ``XtkScene`` ： ``flux_app_attachhost(app)`` 创建绑定到窗口布局根节点的保留式 "
"``XtkHost`` ； ``xtk_scene_fromhost(host)`` 返回按值传递的 ``XtkScene`` 包装结构，"
"其根控件句柄通过 ``xtk_scene_root(&scene)`` 获取。"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:167
msgid ""
"**Commit initial UI and run the message loop**: Populate your initial "
"scene inside an ``XtkTxn``, register an optional ``flux_app_onframe`` "
"hook, and enter the blocking Win32 loop with ``flux_app_run(app)``."
msgstr ""
"**提交初始界面并进入消息循环** ：在 ``XtkTxn`` 事务中构建初始控件树，按需注册 ``flux_app_onframe`` 帧回调，"
"随后调用 ``flux_app_run(app)`` 进入阻塞式 Win32 消息循环。"

#: ../../source/imperative/lifecycle.rst:170
msgid ""
"**Tear down in reverse order**: After ``flux_app_run`` returns, detach "
"the frame callback with ``flux_app_onframe(app, NULL, NULL)``, destroy "
"the host with ``flux_host_destroy(host)``, destroy the app with "
"``flux_app_destroy(app)``, and free any application-owned heap "
"allocations that were borrowed by event subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"**按逆序释放资源** ： ``flux_app_run`` 返回后，依次调用 ``flux_app_onframe(app, NULL, NULL)`` 解除帧回调、"
" ``flux_host_destroy(host)`` 销毁宿主、 ``flux_app_destroy(app)`` 销毁应用实例，最后释放曾被事件监听借用的业务堆内存。"
